{c: Verse 1}
[Bm]Jo tere sang kaati raatein
[A]Jiye jo haseen lamhe
[G]Jo tere sang baati baatein
[A]Bune jo haseen sapne
[Bm]Wo to hai ab bhi wohi khade banke sawaali
[A]Dekhe hai tera rasta hontho pe leke shikwa
[G]Woh ghar kyun bhool gaye tod gaye chod gaye
[F#]Jannat jo tha
[Bm]Hoo.. [A]Hoo [G]Hooo [A]
